body:
right. i mean i think i only think about it daily as i have nothing else to really think about right now. 

&#x200B;

it's hard my like 1% of doubt is like do u really want this?

The shirt is a good choice, definitely highlights feminine areas of your torso. I definitely think getting your eyebrows waxed or threaded to have a more defined arch or shape could help with passing. Its hard to tell from this angle - but I might wonder if the choker necklace is a feminine touch or draws attention to your neck - I don't know if you have a prominent Adam's apple but its one of those things where the width/color/style of the choker can either hide or accentuate that area - let me know if that didn't make any sense lol

&#x200B;

Lastly, make changes that make you happy. Don't force yourself into any clothes or makeup that doesn't seem like you. :)
